t-slate-900\">Charred sourdough</h3>\n                <span className=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-600\">$9</span>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Cultured butter, sea salt, rosemary oil.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-100 to-amber-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Roasted squash</h3>\n                <span className=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-600\">$16</span>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Whipped feta, pepitas, chili honey.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-100 to-amber-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Dry-aged ribeye</h3>\n                <span className=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-600\">$46</span>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Bone marrow butter, market greens.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-100 to-amber-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">House pappardelle</h3>\n                <span className=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-600\">$24</span>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Braised short rib ragu, pecorino.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-100 to-amber-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Olive oil cake</h3>\n                <span className=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-600\">$11</span>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Citrus, mascarpone, toasted almond.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Location.tsx":"export default function Location() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-20\">\n      <div className=\"grid gap-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-8 md:grid-cols-2\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 className=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Visit us</h2>\n          <p className=\"mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600\">412 Elm Street, Downtown — street parking after 6pm.</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-600\">Hours</p>\n          <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Tue–Sun, 5:00pm – 11:00pm. Closed Mondays.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-100 to-amber-50\" />\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-serif text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Request a reservation</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">For parties of 7 or more, please call us directly.</p>\n      <form\n        className=\"mt-8 space-y-4\"\n        onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}\n      >\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        </div>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-amber-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-full bg-amber-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14\">\n        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4\">\n          <div className=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1\">\n            <p className=\"font-serif text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Ember & Oak</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm text-slate-500\">A wood-fired kitchen serving seasonal plates, downtown.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">Visit</p>\n            <ul className=\"mt-3 space-y-2\">\n              <li><a href=\"/menu\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Menu</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Reservations</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">Follow</p>\n            <ul className=\"mt-3 space-y-2\">\n              <li><a href=\"/\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Instagram</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"mt-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:flex-row\">\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Ember & Oak. All rights reserved.</p>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-600\">\n            <span className=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-600\" /> Built with webma\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"slug":"index","path":"/","name":"Home","sections":["Navbar","Hero","Menu","Location","Footer"]},{"slug":"menu","path":"/menu","name":"Menu","sections":["Navbar","Menu","Footer"]},{"slug":"contact","path":"/contact","name":"Reservations","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Location","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb),
  ('da682758-50b2-4c30-9108-275f901f463c', 'Real Estate', 'Skyline Realty', 'A premium real estate site — featured listings grid, agent positioning, and a direct inquiry path.', ARRAY['real-estate', 'listings', 'premium']::text[], 'premium', 'real estate', 'pro', false, $tpl${"files":{"components/Navbar.tsx":"export default function Navbar() {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-slate-100 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur\">\n      <nav className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-4\">\n        <a href=\"/\" className=\"font-sans text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Skyline Realty</a>\n        <div className=\"hidden items-center gap-8 md:flex\">\n        <a href=\"/listings\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Listings</a>\n        <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-md bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-colors\">Get started</a>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n","components/Hero.tsx":"export default function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:grid-cols-2 md:py-32\">\n        <div>\n          <span className=\"inline-block rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700\">Boutique residential brokerage</span>\n          <h1 className=\"font-sans mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-900 md:text-5xl\">Find a place that actually fits your life.</h1>\n          <p className=\"mt-5 max-w-lg text-lg text-slate-600\">Skyline Realty represents buyers and sellers across the metro's most sought-after neighborhoods — no cookie-cutter listings, no pressure.</p>\n          <div className=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\">\n            <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-colors\">Browse listings</a>\n            <a href=\"#features\" className=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors\">Talk to an agent</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 to-emerald-50 ring-1 ring-emerald-100\" />\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Listings.tsx":"export default function Listings() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Featured listings</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">A few of our current favorites.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 to-emerald-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">142 Birchwood Ave</h3>\n                <span className=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600\">$875,000</span>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">4 bed · 3 bath · 2,400 sqft — updated kitchen, private yard.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 to-emerald-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">88 Harbor View Loft</h3>\n                <span className=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600\">$612,000</span>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">2 bed · 2 bath · 1,300 sqft — floor-to-ceiling windows.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 to-emerald-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">27 Meridian Court</h3>\n                <span className=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600\">$1,240,000</span>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">5 bed · 4 bath · 3,600 sqft — corner lot, finished basement.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-100 to-emerald-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">9 Willow Lane</h3>\n                <span className=\"shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-600\">$540,000</span>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">3 bed · 2 bath · 1,850 sqft — move-in ready, quiet street.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Stats.tsx":"export default function Stats() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-slate-50 text-slate-900\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-2 gap-8 px-6 py-16 text-center md:grid-cols-4\">\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-300 md:text-4xl\">310+</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50\">Homes sold</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-300 md:text-4xl\">14</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50\">Neighborhoods</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-300 md:text-4xl\">22 days</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50\">Avg. days on market</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-300 md:text-4xl\">4.95/5</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50\">Client rating</p>\n          </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/ContactForm.tsx":"export default function ContactForm() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <h2 className=\"font-sans text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Let's find your next home</h2>\n      <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">Tell us what you're looking for and an agent will follow up within 24 hours.</p>\n      <form\n        className=\"mt-8 space-y-4\"\n        onSubmit={async (e) => {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          const form = e.currentTarget;\n          const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());\n          const website = data.website;\n          delete data.website;\n          try {\n            await fetch(`${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/public/forms/submit`, {\n              method: \"POST\",\n              headers: { \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\" },\n              body: JSON.stringify({ projectId: \"__WEBMA_PROJECT_ID__\", formName: \"contact\", data, website }),\n            });\n            form.reset();\n          } catch (err) {}\n        }}\n      >\n        <div className=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n          <input name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Your name\" className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n          <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"Email address\" className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        </div>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" required rows={4} placeholder=\"How can we help?\" className=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"website\" tabIndex={-1} autoComplete=\"off\" className=\"sr-only\" aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-600 px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-colors\">Send message</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Footer.tsx":"export default function Footer() {\n  return (\n    <footer className=\"border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14\">\n        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4\">\n          <div className=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1\">\n            <p className=\"font-sans text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Skyline Realty</p>\n            <p className=\"mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm text-slate-500\">A boutique residential brokerage for the metro's best neighborhoods.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">Explore</p>\n            <ul className=\"mt-3 space-y-2\">\n              <li><a href=\"/listings\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Listings</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Contact</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">Legal</p>\n            <ul className=\"mt-3 space-y-2\">\n              <li><a href=\"/\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Fair housing</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"/\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900\">Privacy</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"mt-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:flex-row\">\n          <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Skyline Realty. All rights reserved.</p>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-600\">\n            <span className=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600\" /> Built with webma\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n  );\n}\n"},"pages":[{"slug":"index","path":"/","name":"Home","sections":["Navbar","Hero","Listings","Stats","Footer"]},{"slug":"listings","path":"/listings","name":"Listings","sections":["Navbar","Listings","Footer"]},{"slug":"contact","path":"/contact","name":"Contact","sections":["Navbar","ContactForm","Footer"]}]}$tpl$::jsonb),
  ('78c5a9b7-b11a-4c9a-a871-d9b4c6076a37', 'Healthcare', 'Wellpoint Family Clinic', 'A calm, reassuring clinic site — services overview, hours/location, and an easy booking path.', ARRAY['healthcare', 'clinic', 'medical', 'calm']::text[], 'calm', 'healthcare', 'starter', false, $tpl${"files":{"components/Navbar.tsx":"export default function Navbar() {\n  return (\n    <header className=\"sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-slate-100 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur\">\n      <nav className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-4\">\n        <a href=\"/\" className=\"font-sans text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Wellpoint</a>\n        <div className=\"hidden items-center gap-8 md:flex\">\n        <a href=\"/services\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Services</a>\n        <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Book a visit</a>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-md bg-teal-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-teal-700 transition-colors\">Get started</a>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n  );\n}\n","components/Hero.tsx":"export default function Hero() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"bg-white\">\n      <div className=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:grid-cols-2 md:py-32\">\n        <div>\n          <span className=\"inline-block rounded-full bg-teal-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-700\">Accepting new patients</span>\n          <h1 className=\"font-sans mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-900 md:text-5xl\">Family medicine that actually has time for you.</h1>\n          <p className=\"mt-5 max-w-lg text-lg text-slate-600\">Wellpoint keeps panel sizes small so every visit gets a full 30 minutes — no rushed appointments, no revolving-door doctors.</p>\n          <div className=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\">\n            <a href=\"/contact\" className=\"rounded-full bg-teal-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-teal-700 transition-colors\">Book an appointment</a>\n            <a href=\"#features\" className=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors\">Our services</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-teal-50 ring-1 ring-teal-100\" />\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","components/Services.tsx":"export default function Services() {\n  return (\n    <section className=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20\">\n      <div className=\"max-w-xl\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-sans text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Services</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-3 text-slate-500\">Comprehensive primary care under one roof.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-teal-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Annual physicals</h3>\n                \n              </div>\n              <p className=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500\">Thorough checkups with same-week scheduling.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-100\">\n            <div className=\"aspect-[4/3] bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-100 to-teal-50\" />\n            <div className=\"p-5\">\n              <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                <h3 className=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Chronic care management</h3>\n                \n              </div>\n 